OL,3,ATonnes of dumped rubbish leaves #10m
OL,4,Abusiness park an 'apocalyptic' mess
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn empty multi-million pound business
OL,7,Fpark looks like "an apocalypse" after
OL,8,Ftonnes of rubbish and a caravan was
OL,9,Fdumped on the site by people living
OL,10,Fthere.
OL,12,FBrocastle Business Park in Bridgend was
OL,13,Fbuilt in 2021 with #10m from the Welsh
OL,14,Fgovernment, but locals said about 100
OL,15,Fpeople living in 40 caravans were there
OL,16,Ffor several months.
OL,18,FThe park, which has sat empty for five
OL,19,Fyears, has rubble, garden waste, black
OL,20,Fbags and an old caravan strewn across
OL,21,Fthe vast site.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
